# Screen recordings. Kept OUT of git on purpose: a 6 MB binary is permanent in
# history and can never be pruned without a rewrite. Attach demos to a GitHub
# release or an issue and link them from the README instead. (Raster logos are
# small enough to track — see design/assets/logomark/.)
*.mp4
*.mov

